<title>UK: Reuters 7th ex-UK Asia/Mideast air cargo report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 7th ex-UK Asia/Mideast air cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-UK to Asia/Australasia/Middle East GBP air cargo market rates per kg for a 100kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>		   May 2	April 18</p>
<p>			  NORTH ASIA</p>
<p> LON-HKG	 1.15	  1.18</p>
<p> LON-NRT	 1.88	  1.90</p>
<p> LON-PEK	 1.45	  1.50</p>
<p> LON-SEL	 1.65	  1.68</p>
<p> LON-SHA	 1.50	  1.50</p>
<p> LON-TPE	 1.22	  1.24</p>
<p>	     SOUTH-EAST ASIA/AUSTRALASIA</p>
<p> LON-AKL	2.55	   N.A.</p>
<p> LON-BKK	1.12	   1.12</p>
<p> LON-JAK	1.08	   1.08</p>
<p> LON-KUL	1.00	   1.00</p>
<p> LON-MNL	1.38	   1.40</p>
<p> LON-SIN	1.10	   1.15</p>
<p> LON-SYD	1.95	   1.95</p>
<p>			MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> LON-BAH	0.85	   0.85</p>
<p> LON-DXB	0.72	   0.73</p>
<p> LON-TLV	1.05	   1.05</p>
<p>		 INDIAN SUB-CONTINENT</p>
<p> LON-BOM	0.76	   0.76</p>
<p> LON-DEL	0.72	   0.74</p>
<p> LON-KHI	1.08	   1.08</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller cargo agents based at the three miaan London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in sterling per kilo</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of preices and are indicative of current market activity. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
